# synapse_fbs C headers

Generated with flatcc {{ flatcc_version }}. Reflection schemas generated with
flatc {{ flatbuffers_version }} are included under `bfbs/`. The archive also
ships `topics.json` and `include/synapse/topic_catalog.h` for canonical Zenoh
keys, `TopicId`, root table names, and payload types.

This archive is a generic CMake dependency, not a Zephyr module. Add it with
CMake `FetchContent` and link `synapse_fbs::c` for reader-only accessors.

```cmake
include(FetchContent)

FetchContent_Declare(
  synapse_fbs
  URL https://github.com/CogniPilot/synapse_fbs/releases/download/{{ release_name }}/synapse_fbs-c.tar.gz
  URL_HASH SHA256=<release sha256>
  DOWNLOAD_EXTRACT_TIMESTAMP TRUE
)
FetchContent_MakeAvailable(synapse_fbs)

target_link_libraries(app PRIVATE synapse_fbs::c)
```

Link `synapse_fbs::flatcc_runtime` when using generated builders, verifiers, or
JSON helpers.

```c
#include <synapse/topic_catalog.h>

const synapse_topic_info_t *topic = synapse_topic_by_key("vehicle_health");
```
